% a) A picker never places an item in an occupied slot.

% b) For every slot s, a pickerStoreItem(s) never happens when an earlier
%    pickerStoreItem(s) has happened without a pickerCollectItem(s) in between.

% c)
forall s: SlotId .
  [ true* . pickerStoreItem(toFloor(s), s) . (!pickerCollectItem(toFloor(s), s))* . pickerStoreItem(toFloor(s), s) ] false
